WEBVTT

01:29.280 --> 01:34.440
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.860 --> 01:37.820
[Episode 6]

01:38.509 --> 01:39.229
I guarantee you'll be completely satisfied

01:39.229 --> 01:40.560
once you see this place.

01:41.150 --> 01:42.920
Hello. Come in first.

01:43.229 --> 01:44.640
Thanks for your hard work, Li.

01:44.640 --> 01:45.640
Come in. It's my pleasure.

01:45.640 --> 01:46.070
Come.

01:48.120 --> 01:49.850
Are there any other entrances?

01:50.680 --> 01:51.880
Over there. Let's go.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.430
Do you think I lack the money?

01:55.430 --> 01:56.229
You're right.

01:57.310 --> 01:58.910
We sincerely want to sell it.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.930
Everything is negotiable.

02:01.760 --> 02:02.590
An artist used to

02:02.590 --> 02:04.040
live here.

02:04.640 --> 02:06.350
It has been exceptionally well maintained.

02:06.350 --> 02:07.400
Mr. Li, let's go.

02:07.760 --> 02:09.419
Let's look at the living room.

02:25.850 --> 02:27.579
Mr. Li, this is the living room.

02:28.350 --> 02:29.280
Yes, Mr. Li.

02:30.150 --> 02:31.130
Please take a look

02:31.130 --> 02:32.990
at the overall decoration style.

02:34.870 --> 02:36.360
A fish tank this big,

02:36.470 --> 02:38.020
and they don't even keep a couple of
arowanas in it?

02:38.020 --> 02:38.820
So tasteless.

02:39.450 --> 02:41.360
Mr. Li, I'll get you a few

02:41.360 --> 02:42.760
premium arowanas later.

02:44.120 --> 02:46.240
As you can see,
all the furniture is solid wood.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.030
The style is

02:47.610 --> 02:49.470
solemn, luxurious, and elegant.

02:50.090 --> 02:50.690
By the way,

02:50.880 --> 02:52.110
there is also a big courtyard
in the front.

02:52.110 --> 02:52.680
It's very impressive.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.280
Let me take you to have a look.

02:57.960 --> 02:58.520
Look.

03:01.800 --> 03:02.560
Mr. Li,

03:02.930 --> 03:04.020
there's also

03:04.240 --> 03:05.390
an upper floor.

03:05.710 --> 03:08.910
The house has four bedrooms
and two living areas in total.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.190
I forgot to tell you,

03:25.190 --> 03:26.370
there is also a bar counter here.

03:26.370 --> 03:27.840
You can invite a few friends

03:27.840 --> 03:29.370
over to taste some red wine.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.520
Why is the power out here?

03:38.260 --> 03:39.710
We don't come here very often.

03:39.710 --> 03:41.630
Could the utility bill be overdue?

03:41.630 --> 03:42.190
No.

03:42.190 --> 03:43.590
The fish tank lights are still on.

03:43.590 --> 03:44.960
It's probably an electrical issue.

03:44.960 --> 03:45.870
It's an old house.

03:45.870 --> 03:48.670
We just need to reset the breaker
and it'll be fine.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.430
This place feels creepy.

04:04.150 --> 04:05.430
I'd say we should get

04:05.430 --> 04:06.080
a feng shui master

04:06.080 --> 04:06.870
in here first.

04:06.870 --> 04:07.840
No, no, Mr. Li.

04:07.910 --> 04:09.520
The feng shui is absolutely fine.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.520
Absolutely fine.

04:14.520 --> 04:16.050
There's someone upstairs?

04:16.510 --> 04:17.240
Mrs. Lu,

04:17.779 --> 04:19.790
is there anyone on the second floor?

04:20.070 --> 04:20.829
No one.

04:21.200 --> 04:22.760
I just went up to check.

04:22.790 --> 04:23.990
There is no one there.

04:24.310 --> 04:24.950
Right.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.930
It's just the pipes.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.990
Air bubbles in the plumbing.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.120
You know how sometimes at home

04:41.120 --> 04:43.070
you hear sounds like marbles
rolling around?

04:43.070 --> 04:44.200
Don't try to fool me.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.240
What exactly happened to

04:45.240 --> 04:46.370
the previous owner?

04:46.510 --> 04:48.310
Nothing happened. It's just...

04:48.360 --> 04:49.390
Forget it. I'm not interested anymore.

04:49.390 --> 04:50.040
-Wait.
-Mr. Li!

04:50.040 --> 04:50.800
Mr. Li,

04:51.159 --> 04:51.870
listen to me.

04:51.870 --> 04:53.000
Don't leave, Mr. Li.

04:53.000 --> 04:53.600
Mr. Li.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.600
When you came in just now,

05:04.600 --> 05:06.260
did you see these handprints?

05:07.120 --> 05:07.920
No.

05:08.510 --> 05:09.270
Me neither.

05:10.600 --> 05:12.040
Wow.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.720
Isn't this a Picasso?

05:31.040 --> 05:32.770
There's a Beethoven upstairs.

05:40.040 --> 05:40.870
This way.

05:47.390 --> 05:49.000
Is this a studio too?

05:50.460 --> 05:52.390
These paintings are so beautiful.

05:52.800 --> 05:53.800
Who painted them?

05:55.220 --> 05:56.020
I did.

05:57.430 --> 05:58.430
You did?

05:59.830 --> 06:00.750
You can paint?

06:01.830 --> 06:02.630
What about it?

06:03.720 --> 06:05.080
My hands are so good-looking.

06:05.080 --> 06:06.810
Can't I be good at painting too?

06:08.920 --> 06:10.000
By that logic,

06:10.000 --> 06:11.120
I look so good,

06:11.120 --> 06:13.050
so my handwriting must be good too.

06:13.310 --> 06:15.510
I think you look better playing a ghost.

06:21.720 --> 06:23.190
Isn't this a birch tree?

06:24.310 --> 06:25.570
Did you paint this too?

06:27.360 --> 06:28.890
Just something I sketched.

06:38.430 --> 06:39.270
I saw some paintings

06:39.270 --> 06:41.159
in the studio on the second floor.

06:42.159 --> 06:43.490
Did you paint those too?

06:51.630 --> 06:53.120
Shouldn't there be four paintings?

06:53.120 --> 06:54.100
It looks like one is missing.

06:54.100 --> 06:55.430
You went into that room?

06:55.980 --> 06:57.510
When you said we should split up,

06:57.510 --> 06:58.270
I went in to take a look.

06:58.270 --> 06:59.400
Who told you to go in?

07:03.450 --> 07:04.120
I didn't mean to.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.430
Who told you to go in?

07:13.830 --> 07:14.390
Go.

07:20.450 --> 07:21.310
I'm sorry.

07:22.640 --> 07:23.640
I didn't mean it.

07:31.610 --> 07:32.940
I'll go back first then.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.070
Zhou Wan,

08:03.520 --> 08:04.560
what a surprise.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.190
Didn't we already

08:16.190 --> 08:17.650
have an agreement before?

08:19.630 --> 08:21.290
You wouldn't disturb my life,

08:22.390 --> 08:24.520
and I'd treat your grandma's illness.

08:25.480 --> 08:27.410
That's what we agreed on, isn't it?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.480
Well? Answer me!

08:38.720 --> 08:39.390
Yes.

08:43.120 --> 08:43.720
Yes.

08:46.040 --> 08:47.640
Then what do you mean by this?

08:49.630 --> 08:51.290
Are you playing games with me?

08:53.360 --> 08:55.160
Lu Xixiao and I are just friends.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.670
I also won't tell him

09:00.360 --> 09:01.840
about our relationship.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.090
I haven't asked yet.

09:08.730 --> 09:09.860
How did your exam go?

09:14.120 --> 09:15.050
I didn't take it.

09:16.910 --> 09:17.970
You didn't take it?

09:20.670 --> 09:22.270
Grandma collapsed that day.

09:23.120 --> 09:25.250
It was a heart attack caused by uremia.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.080
Like it or not,

09:30.990 --> 09:32.040
this is fate—

09:33.000 --> 09:34.660
for both you and your grandma.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.300
Do you want to help her get treatment?

09:39.300 --> 09:40.390
I can help you.

09:43.490 --> 09:44.320
But

09:46.240 --> 09:47.360
you have to

09:48.510 --> 09:50.170
keep honoring our agreement.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.270
You cannot appear

09:52.270 --> 09:53.470
in front of Lu Xixiao.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.450
Is that okay?

09:55.840 --> 09:59.040
There's really nothing going on
between Lu Xixiao and me.

10:00.000 --> 10:00.720
Besides,

10:03.120 --> 10:04.510
you already took all of
my father's insurance money

10:04.510 --> 10:05.030
back then.

10:05.030 --> 10:06.150
Your father's insurance payout

10:06.150 --> 10:07.630
was left to me.

10:11.150 --> 10:13.120
It was our joint marital property.

10:13.390 --> 10:15.870
The name on the policy is mine, not yours.

10:17.200 --> 10:18.260
Do you understand?

10:27.510 --> 10:29.310
As for Grandma's medical bills,

10:31.240 --> 10:32.600
just consider it a loan.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.810
I will definitely pay you back.

10:39.110 --> 10:39.840
Look at this.

10:45.120 --> 10:45.840
I've already prepared the money

10:45.840 --> 10:47.480
for you.

10:49.170 --> 10:51.320
But you really can't

10:51.720 --> 10:53.720
keep testing my patience like this.

11:02.610 --> 11:04.240
[Lu Xixiao]

11:20.200 --> 11:22.060
Tell me, how can I still trust you?

11:58.310 --> 12:02.660
[Yangming High School Forum]

12:14.900 --> 12:15.780
Delete him.

12:34.910 --> 12:37.780
[Profile Settings] [Delete]

12:37.800 --> 12:38.900
[Delete contact]

12:38.930 --> 12:39.970
[Please wait.]

12:45.250 --> 12:46.430
The cake is good.

12:46.960 --> 12:47.960
Have a bite first.

12:55.030 --> 12:56.440
I'm sorry, Lu Xixiao.

12:57.150 --> 12:58.360
To save Grandma,

12:58.930 --> 13:00.170
I have no choice.

13:03.280 --> 13:04.880
I didn't...

13:06.320 --> 13:07.480
I didn't mean it.

13:29.950 --> 13:31.310
You two are too selfish.

13:31.440 --> 13:33.520
You've turned this family upside down.

13:33.520 --> 13:34.750
Why can't you understand

13:34.750 --> 13:36.840
that nothing matters more
than family harmony?

13:36.840 --> 13:38.290
Dad, don't be angry.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.150
Calm down, okay?

13:40.150 --> 13:40.550
If

13:40.550 --> 13:41.910
I hadn't used this method,

13:41.910 --> 13:43.910
do you think he would have come back?

13:45.670 --> 13:46.430
Grandpa.

13:50.170 --> 13:52.030
So you still know how to come back.

13:53.830 --> 13:54.810
I know I was wrong.

13:54.810 --> 13:57.940
You know you were wrong?
So where exactly were you wrong?

13:58.710 --> 14:00.240
I was wrong.

14:00.510 --> 14:02.940
I shouldn't have come back at all.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.390
I should've at least texted you

14:04.390 --> 14:06.590
after I landed to let you know I was safe.

14:10.400 --> 14:11.910
It's just a family conflict.

14:11.910 --> 14:12.840
It's no big deal.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.280
Don't worry.

14:14.590 --> 14:16.520
I will always support you.

14:18.240 --> 14:19.690
You support me,

14:20.550 --> 14:21.280
but not everyone

14:21.280 --> 14:22.160
supports me.

14:23.790 --> 14:26.210
You left without saying a word.

14:26.670 --> 14:28.470
Whose support do you still want?

14:30.830 --> 14:31.470
Grandpa,

14:33.240 --> 14:35.300
I want to talk to him alone for a while.

14:39.640 --> 14:41.640
Dad, let me walk you out.

14:44.470 --> 14:45.550
Let me tell you,

14:46.070 --> 14:47.240
nobody is getting their hands

14:47.240 --> 14:48.670
on Shen Lan's property.

14:50.070 --> 14:50.920
Yes.

14:51.160 --> 14:52.430
I didn't handle it well.

14:52.430 --> 14:53.690
It won't happen again.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.510
Shen Lan is Shen Lan,

14:55.590 --> 14:56.450
and you are you.

14:56.790 --> 14:58.190
It will never be the same.

14:58.280 --> 15:00.240
Yes, I misunderstood.

15:02.400 --> 15:04.400
Why did you bring the painting back?

15:05.520 --> 15:06.790
In a few days,

15:06.790 --> 15:08.790
it's Lanyue's 40th
anniversary celebration.

15:08.790 --> 15:10.590
We're hosting a family banquet.

15:11.310 --> 15:13.710
Many business partners will be attending.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.860
Your persona as a devoted husband

15:16.430 --> 15:17.790
gets better every year.

15:18.710 --> 15:19.520
Stop using your words

15:19.520 --> 15:20.610
to mock me.

15:20.630 --> 15:21.350
I'm telling you,

15:21.350 --> 15:23.900
you must attend the event that day.

15:23.920 --> 15:24.890
Because of this,

15:24.920 --> 15:26.120
I made you come back.

15:26.240 --> 15:26.920
Got it?

15:27.640 --> 15:28.920
You never asked me to go

15:28.920 --> 15:30.850
and put on a show in previous years.

15:31.470 --> 15:32.720
You must apologize

15:33.240 --> 15:34.470
to Mr. He's son.

15:39.070 --> 15:39.800
Which Mr. He?

15:41.470 --> 15:42.400
Don't play dumb

15:42.400 --> 15:43.270
with me.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.220
Just be good and apologize to him.

15:48.160 --> 15:50.310
Fine, but I have a condition.

15:50.920 --> 15:51.830
A condition?

15:52.640 --> 15:53.830
You're negotiating with me?

15:53.830 --> 15:54.830
My mom's house...

15:56.830 --> 15:57.670
I never intended to sell

15:57.670 --> 15:59.670
your mom's house in the first place.

16:00.470 --> 16:02.110
As for you going abroad,

16:02.880 --> 16:04.810
it concerns your future after all.

16:04.920 --> 16:05.920
As your father,

16:06.360 --> 16:08.890
it's my responsibility
to think more for you.

16:52.860 --> 16:55.760
[Insurance Contract]

17:01.720 --> 17:02.310
[This insurance contract
is issued by Hengxin Insurance Co., Ltd.]

17:02.330 --> 17:03.130
[hereinafter referred to as "the Insurer," and the policyholder,
Zhou Jun, regarding life insurance matters]

17:03.160 --> 17:04.109
[and constitutes a legally
binding agreement]

17:04.130 --> 17:04.910
[The policyholder refers to the individual
who enters into this insurance contract with the Insurer]

17:04.930 --> 17:05.710
[and pays the premiums as agreed
under the contract. Under this contract]

17:05.740 --> 17:06.640
[Zhou Jun is the insured person, i.e.,
the individual covered by the insured events]

17:10.500 --> 17:14.290
[Beneficiary Clause]

17:16.200 --> 17:17.140
[In this contract, Zhou Jun]

17:17.170 --> 17:18.670
[designates Zhou Wan
as the sole primary beneficiary]

17:21.359 --> 17:22.640
Your father's insurance payout

17:22.640 --> 17:23.880
was left to me.

17:24.560 --> 17:26.430
It's our joint marital property.

17:29.000 --> 17:32.750
[The Insured: Zhou Jun]
[Beneficiary: Zhou Wan]

17:30.920 --> 17:32.080
Like it or not,

17:33.000 --> 17:33.950
this is fate—

17:35.080 --> 17:36.740
for both you and your grandma.

17:41.900 --> 17:42.740
[Signature of insurer's representative:
Zhang Feng]

17:42.760 --> 17:43.940
[Signature of policyholder: Zhou Jun]

18:05.420 --> 18:07.350
[Closed]

18:33.860 --> 18:34.970
[Lanyue Group's first M&A fund
has completed fundraising]

18:34.990 --> 18:36.300
[Lanyue Group's 40th Anniversary
Commemorative Dinner is approaching]

18:36.330 --> 18:37.670
[Gramophone Orchestra will deliver
a spectacular performance]

18:42.320 --> 18:43.380
[Lanyue Group has successfully acquired
a premium overseas land parcel]

18:43.450 --> 18:44.650
[Lanyue Group's 40th Anniversary
Commemorative Dinner is approaching]

18:44.680 --> 18:46.480
[Gramophone Orchestra will deliver
a spectacular performance]

18:46.560 --> 18:47.960
A commemorative dinner?

18:49.470 --> 18:50.490
[The gala is star-studded, with the founder
of Lanyue Group in attendance]

18:49.560 --> 18:51.710
[Core members of
the Lu family are present]

18:50.510 --> 18:51.590
[Mr. Lu is expected to attend
with Chairman Lu Zhongyue and others]

18:51.610 --> 18:52.700
[All core members will make an appearance,
drawing media attention]

18:53.640 --> 18:55.160
At such an important Lu family banquet,

18:55.160 --> 18:56.610
she will definitely attend.

18:56.610 --> 18:57.560
This is my only

18:57.580 --> 18:59.020
chance to save Grandma.

19:05.080 --> 19:05.930
I'm sorry.

19:06.230 --> 19:08.180
I'll tell you everything someday.

19:08.800 --> 19:09.880
But before that,

19:10.320 --> 19:11.660
I want her to pay back

19:11.950 --> 19:13.280
everything she owes me.

19:17.350 --> 19:19.580
[Game Leaderboard]

19:19.400 --> 19:21.180
If his ranking gets overtaken,

19:21.400 --> 19:23.190
he won't be able to sleep at night.

19:23.190 --> 19:24.720
That's how petty he is.

19:43.600 --> 19:48.970
[Game Leaderboard]

19:53.030 --> 19:53.750
What are you doing?

19:53.750 --> 19:55.350
Just get back to first place.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.140
Alright.

19:59.230 --> 20:00.510
She even dressed up as a ghost
to help you scare people,

20:00.510 --> 20:02.080
but you turned around and kicked her out.

20:02.080 --> 20:03.810
No wonder she blacklisted you.

20:04.430 --> 20:05.670
She gave you a way out.

20:05.670 --> 20:06.930
Couldn't you see that?

20:06.990 --> 20:08.180
I saw it.

20:08.270 --> 20:08.920
So what?

20:09.430 --> 20:11.690
It's not up to her
whether I take it or not.

20:12.920 --> 20:14.320
Come on, it's not that serious.

20:14.320 --> 20:15.400
I already created an opportunity for you.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.640
Talk to her nicely later, okay?

20:16.640 --> 20:18.470
Don't do anything unnecessary here.

20:18.470 --> 20:20.230
Good job. Are you thirsty?

20:22.030 --> 20:22.710
Where are you going?

20:22.710 --> 20:23.970
None of your business.

20:28.640 --> 20:30.170
I'll drink it. I'm thirsty.

20:31.800 --> 20:32.510
Thanks.

20:34.430 --> 20:36.230
One is more stubborn than the other.

20:36.230 --> 20:37.090
Unbelievable.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.670
You can't even take care of yourself;

20:44.670 --> 20:46.430
why are you treating me to a meal?

20:46.430 --> 20:47.470
I haven't thanked you properly
for lending me

20:47.470 --> 20:48.800
your scooter last time.

20:48.990 --> 20:50.270
I can still afford to treat you

20:50.270 --> 20:51.270
to afternoon tea.

20:51.430 --> 20:52.430
Just enjoy your food

20:52.430 --> 20:53.230
and that's it.

20:53.510 --> 20:54.670
You're so generous.

20:56.640 --> 20:57.600
Besides,

20:58.360 --> 21:00.220
I have something to ask you today.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.710
I knew it.

21:02.270 --> 21:03.670
You wouldn't come to me for nothing.

21:03.670 --> 21:04.080
You treating me

21:04.080 --> 21:05.810
is definitely not that simple.

21:06.030 --> 21:06.640
Tell me.

21:08.270 --> 21:10.320
Under what circumstances
do you think a guy

21:10.320 --> 21:11.160
would take a girl

21:11.160 --> 21:12.230
home?

21:15.510 --> 21:17.040
Who are you going home with?

21:17.510 --> 21:18.190
Lu Xixiao.

21:18.560 --> 21:19.420
Do you like him?

21:19.560 --> 21:20.190
I don't.

21:20.190 --> 21:22.030
You don't like him
but you're going home with him?

21:22.030 --> 21:22.880
I have some business with him.

21:22.880 --> 21:23.740
What business?

21:25.880 --> 21:27.160
Can I not say it for now?

21:27.160 --> 21:27.950
Boring.

21:29.120 --> 21:30.160
Don't you guys know each other?

21:30.160 --> 21:31.490
Just tell him directly.

21:35.470 --> 21:37.080
I had a fight with him

21:37.750 --> 21:39.210
and deleted him on WeChat.

21:39.840 --> 21:40.510
And then?

21:41.990 --> 21:42.950
I originally wanted to talk to him

21:42.950 --> 21:43.800
at the arcade.

21:44.670 --> 21:46.160
But he ignored me

21:46.270 --> 21:47.190
and just left.

21:48.190 --> 21:49.250
That's pretty bad.

21:49.840 --> 21:50.840
Tell me about it.

21:52.920 --> 21:53.750
Let me think.

21:56.880 --> 21:57.750
No rush.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.270
I have an idea,

22:05.640 --> 22:07.750
but it depends on
whether you can accept it.

22:07.750 --> 22:08.600
What idea?

22:12.990 --> 22:15.470
Abandon dignity.

22:17.750 --> 22:19.640
You need to add him back on WeChat first.

22:19.640 --> 22:21.320
Aren't you going to work this afternoon?

22:21.320 --> 22:22.610
Just do as I say.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.360
We're currently running a

22:28.360 --> 22:29.800
top-up promotion at the store.

22:29.800 --> 22:30.400
If you're interested,

22:30.400 --> 22:31.190
feel free to add me on WeChat.

22:30.570 --> 22:30.770
[Zhou Wan]

22:32.890 --> 22:36.400
[Zhou Wan]

22:38.710 --> 22:39.970
I'm not short of money.

22:41.460 --> 22:42.250
[Zhou Wan]

22:41.510 --> 22:43.610
Don't. I'll add you.

22:44.080 --> 22:45.820
How can you be so shameless?

22:45.990 --> 22:48.120
We need to approach this from the side.

22:49.430 --> 22:51.430
Tell me something I can understand.

22:51.750 --> 22:53.030
Jiang Fan.

22:53.640 --> 22:54.160
He

22:54.160 --> 22:55.640
comes to the store to see me every day.

22:55.640 --> 22:57.840
He should be useful for something else.

22:58.320 --> 23:00.430
You mean asking Jiang Fan for help?

23:01.800 --> 23:03.730
Since when did you two get so close?

23:04.400 --> 23:05.260
Not important.

23:05.600 --> 23:07.510
Anyway, he goes to my uncle's store
every day.

23:07.510 --> 23:08.510
I'll just ask him.

23:10.600 --> 23:11.270
Well,

23:11.400 --> 23:13.160
Wan and I brought some noodles

23:13.160 --> 23:14.020
for you.

23:15.400 --> 23:16.360
Look, Xixiao.

23:16.430 --> 23:18.230
They really packed some seafood noodles.

23:18.230 --> 23:18.750
You said you wanted

23:18.750 --> 23:20.160
this earlier, didn't you?

23:20.160 --> 23:21.190
Ms. Zhou really understands you.

23:21.190 --> 23:22.400
I'm not hungry.

23:24.230 --> 23:24.800
And,

23:25.230 --> 23:26.360
if you tip them off again,

23:26.360 --> 23:27.160
just you wait.

23:30.120 --> 23:31.650
Who made the floor so dirty?

23:32.880 --> 23:33.610
Who did this?

23:36.160 --> 23:37.430
If he doesn't eat it, I will.

23:37.430 --> 23:38.800
Give it to me. I'm hungry.

23:38.800 --> 23:39.840
Save some for me.

23:39.840 --> 23:40.680
No way.

23:41.270 --> 23:42.400
He's so ungrateful.

23:42.510 --> 23:44.170
He'll behave after a beating!

23:45.270 --> 23:47.190
Keep your voice down.

23:47.600 --> 23:48.600
I have no choice.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.570
I'm the one asking for his help.

23:53.230 --> 23:54.510
There's another way.

23:55.230 --> 23:56.560
Act pitiful.

24:14.840 --> 24:15.950
That's enough.

24:17.910 --> 24:19.400
She's been working overtime for days.

24:19.400 --> 24:20.600
She switched shifts just to...

24:20.600 --> 24:21.270
For what?

24:24.160 --> 24:25.220
Feel sorry for her?

24:26.030 --> 24:27.230
Then cover her shift.

24:30.880 --> 24:32.120
I don't.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.290
I'm just sleepy.

24:45.710 --> 24:47.370
You really are hard-hearted.

24:47.510 --> 24:48.710
I'm hard-hearted?

24:52.030 --> 24:54.090
I lent you my motorbike for a few days.

24:54.750 --> 24:55.840
And the rearview mirror is gone.

24:55.840 --> 24:56.900
I'm hard-hearted?

24:57.230 --> 24:58.950
Xixiao, the girls who are into you

24:58.950 --> 25:00.120
could line up from the school gate
all the way

25:00.120 --> 25:01.270
to the teaching building.

25:01.270 --> 25:03.230
You really can't see
what she's getting at?

25:03.230 --> 25:04.080
Miss Straight-A has gone

25:04.080 --> 25:05.130
this far.

25:05.430 --> 25:06.430
Stop pretending.

25:06.560 --> 25:08.020
She's the one pretending.

25:08.430 --> 25:09.990
You want to see her too, don't you?

25:09.990 --> 25:11.080
Otherwise, why do you go to the arcade

25:11.080 --> 25:11.710
every day?

25:11.840 --> 25:12.800
You never used to be this hooked

25:12.800 --> 25:13.430
on games.

25:13.710 --> 25:15.570
Why act tough? I don't even get it.

25:15.640 --> 25:16.990
Are you done, Jiang Fan?

25:18.400 --> 25:20.260
Fine, fine, I won't get involved.

25:20.320 --> 25:21.510
I'm not getting involved, okay?

25:21.510 --> 25:22.750
My brother stayed,

25:23.840 --> 25:26.430
leaving behind a bunch of
emotional problems,

25:26.430 --> 25:27.800
and the motorbike
I got my hands on is gone.

25:27.800 --> 25:28.710
You might as well have left.

25:28.710 --> 25:30.320
Good thing I stayed.

25:30.800 --> 25:31.490
Look at the motorbike

25:31.490 --> 25:32.290
you messed up.

25:35.560 --> 25:36.230
Aren't you planning to

25:36.230 --> 25:37.430
go out again later anyway?

25:37.430 --> 25:37.840
When the time comes...

25:37.840 --> 25:38.840
In your dreams.

25:38.950 --> 25:39.950
The dream is here.

25:40.080 --> 25:41.710
I'm getting off work.

25:42.030 --> 25:44.030
You're getting off work this early?

25:44.360 --> 25:45.750
Bye, Uncle.

25:46.230 --> 25:46.840
Now you remember

25:46.840 --> 25:48.160
I'm your uncle, right?

25:49.430 --> 25:50.690
Be careful on the road.

25:51.430 --> 25:52.400
Alright, Xixiao.

25:52.400 --> 25:52.920
It is fixed.

25:52.920 --> 25:53.750
Check it out.

25:54.400 --> 25:56.330
Check? It's the motorbike I fixed.

25:56.430 --> 25:57.830
You didn't even touch it.

25:57.840 --> 25:58.320
I...

25:58.430 --> 25:59.640
You used my tools.

26:02.430 --> 26:03.750
Since you care so much,

26:03.750 --> 26:05.280
and fix motorbikes so well,

26:05.320 --> 26:06.190
why don't you stay

26:06.190 --> 26:07.720
and fix motorbikes with me?

26:08.190 --> 26:10.120
He has a lot of things to care about.

26:16.960 --> 26:19.610
[Inpatient Building]

26:23.320 --> 26:24.030
Grandma.

26:24.430 --> 26:25.400
I'm here to see you.

26:25.400 --> 26:26.030
Okay.

26:26.030 --> 26:27.490
What are you listening to?

26:27.510 --> 26:29.430
It's called Phonograph Band.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.710
Do you want to listen?

26:30.800 --> 26:31.920
Why would he?

26:31.920 --> 26:33.430
You listen to it if you like.

26:33.430 --> 26:34.400
Didn't I tell you

26:34.400 --> 26:36.130
not to come all the way to see us?

26:36.230 --> 26:37.560
Grandma is much better.

26:37.840 --> 26:38.710
If you don't bother me,

26:38.710 --> 26:39.810
I feel uneasy.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.750
I... I was afraid

26:42.030 --> 26:43.630
you'd be mad about last time.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.030
Let's talk outside.

26:46.030 --> 26:46.560
Okay.

26:50.950 --> 26:51.680
These are

26:51.710 --> 26:54.030
materials and admissions brochures

26:54.160 --> 26:54.840
from some local universities

26:54.840 --> 26:55.900
in Pingchuan City.

26:55.990 --> 26:56.800
Take a look.

26:57.990 --> 26:58.640
What,

26:59.030 --> 26:59.950
you don't want me to apply to

26:59.950 --> 27:02.080
Huaqing University with you anymore?

27:02.120 --> 27:04.660
Of course I still want to,

27:05.710 --> 27:06.430
but

27:08.430 --> 27:10.030
your life is your own choice.

27:12.990 --> 27:13.640
Thank you.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.300
Your birthday is in a few days.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.900
Have you thought about how to celebrate?

27:23.600 --> 27:24.460
Same as always.

27:26.400 --> 27:27.030
Okay.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.230
Can you play properly?

27:32.230 --> 27:34.490
How are we supposed to break this record?

27:36.190 --> 27:37.120
Buy some tokens.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.570
I'm out of money.

27:41.430 --> 27:42.270
How can you be out of money?

27:42.270 --> 27:44.470
You spent it all because of your gaming.

27:48.510 --> 27:49.190
Let's go.

27:54.670 --> 27:55.800
Zhou Wan isn't here.

27:59.670 --> 28:02.940
[The sunset stage]

28:00.140 --> 28:01.890
♪ Even if you remove the rooted mask ♪

28:01.710 --> 28:03.710
I didn't even work this hard
when I was studying.

28:02.870 --> 28:05.250
♪ Let joy and sorrow be laid bare ♪

28:04.510 --> 28:05.600
He's completely unresponsive—

28:05.600 --> 28:06.320
nothing gets through to him,
not persuasion, not pressure.

28:06.150 --> 28:09.030
♪ Still cannot hide the shadow behind ♪

28:07.430 --> 28:09.950
He seems to care about you quite a bit.

28:10.010 --> 28:12.590
♪ That's all it is ♪

28:11.990 --> 28:13.510
Whose side are you on anyway?

28:13.510 --> 28:16.200
♪ If meeting means destined separation ♪

28:13.600 --> 28:14.330
He's no good.

28:14.560 --> 28:16.080
He's completely unresponsive.

28:16.080 --> 28:16.750
Ignore him.

28:16.980 --> 28:20.070
♪ Then it is an addiction
life cannot bear ♪

28:17.470 --> 28:18.600
Listen to the music.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.980
Give me your phone.

28:24.230 --> 28:24.980
Why?

28:25.320 --> 28:26.600
I'm out of money.
What do you need my phone for?

28:26.600 --> 28:27.930
Mind your own business.

28:29.020 --> 28:32.220
That's all.

28:32.250 --> 28:34.090
[The sunset stage]

28:35.230 --> 28:36.880
♪ When, where ♪

28:35.730 --> 28:38.800
♪ When, where, has it ever appeared ♪

28:36.880 --> 28:38.710
♪ Has it ever appeared ♪

28:38.710 --> 28:40.470
♪ A world without ignorance ♪

28:38.960 --> 28:42.550
♪ A world without ignorance,
without desire, without end ♪

28:40.470 --> 28:42.470
♪ Without desire, without end ♪

28:42.470 --> 28:44.080
♪ I come, I go ♪

28:42.680 --> 28:45.450
♪ I come, I go, I stay,
yet I am not myself ♪

28:44.320 --> 28:44.990
Hello?

28:45.710 --> 28:47.370
You can't even hold on to this?

28:48.080 --> 28:49.430
I told you.

28:49.690 --> 28:51.730
[The sunset stage]

28:49.840 --> 28:52.030
Good!

28:52.030 --> 28:52.960
Let's continue.

28:53.510 --> 28:54.400
Everyone together, okay?

28:54.400 --> 28:56.950
Lu Xixiao, what are you pretending for?

28:57.440 --> 29:00.470
♪ Come as expected ♪

28:59.030 --> 29:00.510
We did it!

29:01.320 --> 29:04.920
-What are you talking about?
-Give yourself a round of applause!

29:06.190 --> 29:07.430
Put your hands up!

29:17.670 --> 29:18.230
Zhou Wan?

29:19.430 --> 29:20.270
Why are you here?

29:20.270 --> 29:21.030
It's already after hours.

29:21.030 --> 29:21.960
Just passing by.

29:22.360 --> 29:23.750
I'll get going then.

29:24.840 --> 29:26.030
-Bye. Bye.
-Bye.

29:36.430 --> 29:37.290
Looking for me?

29:42.320 --> 29:43.920
I didn't take you for someone

29:44.430 --> 29:45.670
this good at gaming.

29:51.190 --> 29:51.990
Just average.

29:56.320 --> 29:57.320
Stop pretending.

29:58.600 --> 29:59.400
You've been hounding me

29:59.400 --> 30:00.650
every day like this—

30:01.560 --> 30:04.020
are you just trying to piss me off
on purpose?

30:12.190 --> 30:14.320
I thought you didn't want to talk to me.

30:25.320 --> 30:26.400
Actually, I wanted to tell you
the other day

30:26.400 --> 30:27.600
that I was also wrong.

30:28.230 --> 30:29.560
But then you deleted me.

30:32.640 --> 30:33.600
What did you say?

30:38.120 --> 30:40.030
I said, I was also wrong.

30:41.990 --> 30:43.390
I lost my temper that day.

30:43.750 --> 30:45.480
I shouldn't have yelled at you.

30:46.270 --> 30:47.470
But no matter what,

30:48.320 --> 30:49.190
I feel like our relationship

30:49.190 --> 30:49.750
shouldn't have reached

30:49.750 --> 30:51.210
the point of cutting ties.

30:56.160 --> 30:57.620
What is our relationship?

31:05.710 --> 31:06.910
Teacher and student?

31:11.840 --> 31:12.510
Friends?

31:13.800 --> 31:15.520
We once saved a fish together

31:15.990 --> 31:17.190
and dressed up and acted like
ghosts together.

31:17.190 --> 31:19.000
♪ Give me some candlelight ♪

31:17.800 --> 31:18.930
You still remember?

31:19.030 --> 31:19.920
My memory isn't that bad.

31:19.920 --> 31:20.430
Okay?

31:20.660 --> 31:22.420
♪ Let it illuminate his face ♪

31:23.770 --> 31:25.270
♪ if your voice is hoarse ♪

31:26.090 --> 31:28.320
♪ It'll lead to more imaginations ♪

31:30.630 --> 31:32.090
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

31:31.230 --> 31:32.320
Then

31:33.930 --> 31:35.910
♪ Has filled the corridor ♪

31:33.950 --> 31:34.840
why don't you

31:36.400 --> 31:37.510
add me back?

31:37.290 --> 31:38.870
♪ Wet clothes ♪

31:39.930 --> 31:42.390
♪ Flowing waves ♪

31:40.270 --> 31:40.920
What?

31:43.190 --> 31:44.230
Add me back.

31:44.020 --> 31:46.280
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

31:47.410 --> 31:49.640
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

31:50.670 --> 31:52.390
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

31:54.160 --> 31:56.390
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

31:54.320 --> 31:55.190
Mr. Bow,

31:57.480 --> 32:00.070
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

32:00.360 --> 32:01.190
one more round?

32:01.050 --> 32:03.150
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

32:04.620 --> 32:06.710
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

32:05.120 --> 32:05.990
Just because you told me
to compete with you,

32:05.990 --> 32:07.450
I have to compete with you?

32:08.130 --> 32:09.760
♪ It's getting late ♪

32:11.470 --> 32:12.820
♪ His obsession ♪

32:15.080 --> 32:17.000
♪ Keep everything in mind ♪

32:17.400 --> 32:18.470
Kiddo

32:18.140 --> 32:19.520
♪ The record is spinning ♪

32:20.720 --> 32:22.880
♪ Let me finish this cigarette ♪

32:21.430 --> 32:22.430
I'm not afraid.

32:25.010 --> 32:26.490
♪ Just stay here with me ♪

32:28.540 --> 32:30.170
♪ Even if we just wander around ♪

32:31.670 --> 32:33.200
♪ And do nothing ♪

32:34.220 --> 32:34.990
♪ Go on a date with me ♪

32:35.950 --> 32:39.920
♪ On this Sunday night ♪

32:50.440 --> 32:53.740
[Game Leaderboard]

32:52.990 --> 32:53.840
Yes!

32:54.750 --> 32:55.360
I won.

32:55.360 --> 32:56.640
We won.

32:57.160 --> 32:57.800
Okay.

32:58.670 --> 32:59.990
I'll count you in.

33:00.640 --> 33:01.640
I just blocked a bullet

33:01.640 --> 33:02.700
for you back there.

33:02.840 --> 33:04.440
How are you going to thank me?

33:05.840 --> 33:07.500
How do you want me to thank you?

33:18.510 --> 33:21.080
I heard your banquet

33:21.160 --> 33:22.400
hired a band.

33:23.510 --> 33:26.080
I really like that band.

33:26.990 --> 33:28.510
Can I go see them live?

33:28.950 --> 33:30.480
You came to me just for this?

33:30.880 --> 33:32.540
Why didn't you say so earlier?

33:33.160 --> 33:35.290
Would you have said yes if I just asked?

33:36.820 --> 33:39.590
Besides, for such a grand party,

33:40.190 --> 33:42.920
I probably can't even get in.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.560
Besides,

33:49.430 --> 33:50.880
I'm asking for a favor,

33:51.430 --> 33:53.230
and I just deleted you
on WeChat a second ago.

33:53.230 --> 33:54.830
What song do you want to hear?

33:59.230 --> 34:00.360
I actually have one.

34:03.430 --> 34:04.120
Sure.

34:05.710 --> 34:06.840
Come early that day.

34:10.150 --> 34:10.760
Really?

34:17.840 --> 34:18.920
It's a party.

34:20.110 --> 34:22.110
You should think about what to wear.

34:23.800 --> 34:25.030
What should I wear?

34:28.100 --> 34:29.440
Anything is fine.

34:29.590 --> 34:30.650
It doesn't matter.

34:33.469 --> 34:34.360
Lu Xixiao,

34:34.949 --> 34:36.590
I hope you won't blame me

34:36.840 --> 34:37.840
after that day.

34:40.070 --> 34:41.150
Happy birthday.

34:41.630 --> 34:42.360
Thanks, Mom.

34:45.420 --> 34:46.310
Back then,

34:47.110 --> 34:49.440
registering you for household residency

34:49.469 --> 34:50.880
delayed your schooling,

34:51.800 --> 34:53.659
but luckily my son worked hard

34:53.760 --> 34:55.620
and got into the best university.

34:56.550 --> 34:57.990
I am really proud of you.

35:02.510 --> 35:03.070
Mom,

35:03.280 --> 35:04.880
you're drinking this early?

35:04.920 --> 35:06.120
I am just happy today.

35:08.630 --> 35:10.320
Yan, come.

35:23.470 --> 35:24.730
After all these years,

35:25.430 --> 35:26.690
we've finally made it.

35:27.880 --> 35:30.400
Back then, they looked down on you

35:31.470 --> 35:32.600
and didn't want you.

35:35.320 --> 35:35.980
Never mind.

35:36.320 --> 35:37.450
It's your birthday.

35:38.280 --> 35:39.740
Let's not talk about this.

35:41.280 --> 35:41.920
Did you

35:43.510 --> 35:44.840
set a time with him?

35:46.400 --> 35:47.730
We're meeting tonight.

35:48.200 --> 35:48.880
Remember,

35:49.320 --> 35:50.400
when you go there for dinner,

35:50.400 --> 35:51.360
stand tall.

35:57.240 --> 35:58.100
Come here, son.

35:59.240 --> 36:01.170
This is a birthday present for you.

36:01.430 --> 36:02.110
A fountain pen

36:02.110 --> 36:03.280
specially customized for you.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.920
Your name is even engraved on it.

36:03.420 --> 36:06.120
[Jiang Yan]

36:06.070 --> 36:07.530
Take a look. Do you like it?

36:10.110 --> 36:10.680
I hope

36:10.680 --> 36:12.210
that when you go to college,

36:12.360 --> 36:13.820
you'll study even harder.

36:14.110 --> 36:14.760
If you and your mother

36:14.760 --> 36:16.110
need anything in the future,

36:16.110 --> 36:17.400
come to me anytime.

36:18.680 --> 36:19.320
No need.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.680
What's wrong, Yan?

36:26.550 --> 36:28.110
What's with this shirt?

36:28.990 --> 36:29.590
Why is there

36:29.590 --> 36:30.880
such a big loose thread here?

36:30.880 --> 36:31.540
This shirt.

36:33.400 --> 36:33.950
Gao!

36:34.400 --> 36:34.760
Come here.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.240
Mr. Lu.

36:35.470 --> 36:35.950
Mr. Lu.

36:36.510 --> 36:37.970
After the birthday party,

36:38.150 --> 36:40.100
take him to buy some nice clothes.

36:40.430 --> 36:41.430
Make sure they're name brand.

36:41.430 --> 36:42.230
Do you hear me?

36:42.280 --> 36:43.010
Understood.

36:43.070 --> 36:43.600
Go ahead.

36:47.280 --> 36:48.360
I came here today

36:48.400 --> 36:49.930
to make things clear to you.

36:50.950 --> 36:51.430
Over the years,

36:51.430 --> 36:52.990
you have fulfilled your duties
as a father.

36:52.990 --> 36:54.050
I am very grateful.

36:54.320 --> 36:55.720
But we both know very well

36:56.280 --> 36:57.610
that we are not a family,

36:58.320 --> 36:59.510
and we never will be.

37:01.550 --> 37:02.880
My mother is excellent.

37:03.720 --> 37:04.600
The child she raised

37:04.600 --> 37:05.280
is also excellent,

37:05.280 --> 37:06.940
and no worse than anyone else.

37:09.070 --> 37:11.360
From now on,
whether it's financial support

37:11.360 --> 37:12.240
or upbringing,

37:13.070 --> 37:13.880
I will no longer accept

37:13.880 --> 37:15.150
anything from the Lu family.

37:15.150 --> 37:15.920
So,

37:18.070 --> 37:19.330
please take this back.

37:31.360 --> 37:32.510
Your mother raised you

37:32.510 --> 37:33.840
really well.

37:34.950 --> 37:36.550
You want to rely on yourself.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.930
As a father, I have no objections.

37:39.800 --> 37:41.430
But you have your attitude,

37:41.510 --> 37:42.990
and I have mine.

37:43.720 --> 37:44.450
Understand?

37:45.550 --> 37:46.940
As for this meal,

37:47.590 --> 37:49.790
I really don't have time to eat with you.

37:50.990 --> 37:52.450
I have a lot of things to do.

38:00.070 --> 38:00.840
Gao!

38:01.390 --> 38:02.190
M-Mr. Lu.

38:04.360 --> 38:04.950
Keep him company later

38:04.950 --> 38:06.550
and celebrate his birthday.

38:06.840 --> 38:07.720
O-Okay.

38:08.360 --> 38:09.890
Give him whatever he wants.

38:17.880 --> 38:18.510
Thank you.

38:28.400 --> 38:30.990
Why would Lu Xixiao come here?

38:32.400 --> 38:33.110
Jiang Yan!

38:37.240 --> 38:39.440
I just came back from dinner with my dad.

38:39.510 --> 38:40.360
You...

38:40.880 --> 38:41.810
Perfect timing.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.610
Wait for me on the rooftop.

38:43.610 --> 38:44.810
I haven't forgotten.

39:22.470 --> 39:23.070
Hello.

39:23.470 --> 39:23.990
Hello.

39:24.070 --> 39:24.680
Come here.

39:24.920 --> 39:26.180
How can I help you, sir?

39:52.030 --> 39:56.430
Happy birthday to you.

39:56.880 --> 40:01.280
Happy birthday to you.

40:01.990 --> 40:06.280
Happy birthday to you.

40:06.680 --> 40:09.280
Happy birthday to you.

40:10.180 --> 40:11.380
The usual.

40:12.150 --> 40:14.140
A small cake every year.

40:14.250 --> 40:15.510
It belongs only to you,

40:15.550 --> 40:17.150
not to be shared with anyone.

40:17.550 --> 40:18.360
Right?

40:19.200 --> 40:20.400
The skewers are mine.

40:21.470 --> 40:22.200
Make a wish.

40:27.070 --> 40:27.950
My first wish

40:28.400 --> 40:30.590
is for Grandma to get better soon

40:31.150 --> 40:32.720
and stay healthy and safe.

40:34.880 --> 40:36.940
Then I thank you on Grandma's behalf.

40:37.030 --> 40:37.950
My second wish

40:38.760 --> 40:39.630
is that

40:40.760 --> 40:42.720
Zhou Wan will promise me something.

40:42.720 --> 40:43.430
Me?

40:44.630 --> 40:45.400
What is it?

40:49.110 --> 40:50.470
I know you've been

40:50.490 --> 40:51.570
exhausted lately.

40:52.360 --> 40:54.070
I want you to relax.

40:58.020 --> 41:00.300
[Pingchuan Art Museum Exhibition Ticket]

40:58.200 --> 40:59.660
You go to art exhibitions?

41:00.760 --> 41:02.030
Haven't I been helping out
at the orphanage

41:02.030 --> 41:03.430
for my resume?

41:03.720 --> 41:04.990
A sponsor gave them to me.

41:04.990 --> 41:06.390
He often visits the kids.

41:06.990 --> 41:08.200
When is it?

41:08.400 --> 41:09.200
Next Tuesday.

41:10.590 --> 41:11.590
Next Tuesday.

41:12.800 --> 41:14.110
Why? Are you busy?

41:14.990 --> 41:17.250
It's the same day as the Lu family dinner.

41:17.800 --> 41:18.730
I should make it.

41:19.430 --> 41:20.200
Keep the tickets for now.

41:20.200 --> 41:21.660
I'm afraid I'll lose them.

41:23.750 --> 41:24.540
All right.

41:26.070 --> 41:27.270
Okay, your last wish.

41:31.070 --> 41:32.670
I don't have any more wishes.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.580
I'll save the last one for you.

41:34.720 --> 41:35.720
It's your birthday.

41:35.720 --> 41:37.280
Why should I make a wish?

41:39.400 --> 41:40.430
Besides Grandma,

41:41.200 --> 41:43.000
don't you have any other wishes?

41:49.550 --> 41:51.030
Then wish me luck.
